</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The reverse stock split has not yet been effected as of the date of this Current Report on Form <span style="white-space:nowrap">8-K.</span> </p> <p style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold">Proposal 3 &#8211;Amendment and Restatement of the 2021 Equity Incentive Plan </p> <p style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The stockholders approved the Amended and Restated Plan by the following votes: </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
